### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Login page (render HTML)
GET http://localhost:8080/login

### Login inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=admin@finops.local&password=senha_errada

### Login válido (esperado: 303 + Set-Cookie finops_session)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=admin@finops.local&password=123456

### Home sem sessão (esperado: redirect para /login)
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Home com sessão (copie o cookie retornado no login)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Cookie: finops_session={{session_id}}

### Logout com sessão (esperado: expirar cookie + redirect /login)
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
Cookie: finops_session={{session_id}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_csrf={{csrf_token}}

### Teste CSRF inválido (quando middleware CSRF estiver ativo)
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
Cookie: finops_session={{session_id}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_csrf=token_invalido


### @name create_category 
POST http://localhost:8080/category
Cookie: finops_session={{session_id}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded